logs/
backups/

# `web/` used to be excluded here, from when it held the FastAPI prototype that
# was never containerised. It is now a Go service whose image builds from this
# same repo-root context, so excluding it made `COPY web/ ./` fail with a
# confusing "/web": not found -- the directory is plainly on disk, and only the
# build context is missing it. The bot images do not COPY anything from web/,
# so carrying it costs them context size and nothing else.

*.md
node_modules/
